<title>UK: State Bank NSW sets A$100 million Dec 2001 bond.</title>
<headline>State Bank NSW sets A$100 million Dec 2001 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   STATE BANK OF NEW SOUTH WALES</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  GOVERNMENT OF STATE OF NEW SOUTH WALES</p>
<p> AMT    A$100 MLN     COUPON     5.75	MATURITY    18.DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.715   PAY DATE   S02.SEP.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.75	LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> NOTES	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/AU</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  AUSTRALIA TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  0.125</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED UNDER MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
